From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phone Vault Project <build@phonevault.invalid>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 20:31:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] core: export fixed-function owner resource internally

Framework resources referenced through com.android.internal.R require an
explicit java-symbol declaration. Export the appliance owner configuration so
DevicePolicyManagerService can consume the value introduced by the preceding
patch.

Android 17 rebase of patches/frameworks-base/0004 (context only).
---
diff --git a/core/res/res/values/symbols.xml b/core/res/res/values/symbols.xml
index f20a2b6a0..1214550b0 100644
--- a/core/res/res/values/symbols.xml
+++ b/core/res/res/values/symbols.xml
@@ -5537,6 +5537,8 @@
 
   <java-symbol type="string" name="config_devicePolicyManagementUpdater" />
 
+  <java-symbol type="string" name="config_fixedFunctionDeviceOwner" />
+
   <java-symbol type="string" name="config_deviceSpecificDeviceStatePolicyProvider" />
 
   <java-symbol type="array" name="config_dockExtconStateMapping" />
--
2.50.1
